Z||000002||1FST2M6||12-14-2000||03:50 PM||||just cut and pasted it... <P>HEH.. yeah that's my Girlfriend (Lyndsay) getting off my motorcycle. first off, thanks!  and as for the laundry list.. ok the Color is 2000 Lotus Commemorative Edition Chrome Orange (code F0262/HE01) there are 500 Lotus' painted this color in the world... and now one Fiero (it's basicly a Ford mustang orange with 7oz of blue pearl and 9oz of gold pearl in a tinted clear) all the painted used was Sikkens Epoxy base. the wheels are Enkei Phalnex (17x7f, and 17x8r) on Dunlop W10 215-45f, and 235-40r. the custom sail panels are from the Fiero warehouse for $200 set. it has custom wound springs from Panoz Racing. a friend works there and used their machine to wind what I wanted.. 730lb springs up from and 910lb springs in the back, both with 2.13" drop. Bilstien struts and shocks. aluminum cradle mounts, rear window tinted (previous owner) I'm having it stripped off and all the windows retinted to match the 1/4 windows. I've shaved the emblem off the nose and located the antenna to under the dash (fiber glassed the factory antenna hole) The roof and wing are a Sikkens mixing black. the only black with no other tints to it. the entire car has been wet sanded with 2000 grit and buffed to the mirror you see... I got the black top idea from a couple people... BBBAD GT has an 84 with a 350.. his roof was black, a friend of mine has a 328GTVSi his targa roof is black and the Lamborghini Diablo SV Monterey Edition roof is black. the black wing also came from the Monterey Edition Diablo SV. My 86 NOS SE also has/had a black wing. I see Lamborghini's a lot, I own an Alfa Romeo 164L and the Alfa dealer I get parts from sells Lotus and Lamborghini also. <P>what kind of caddy motor are you putting in it? the 4.1? or like an older 429? got any pics? attached are other pics of my car... the turbo to soon be installed by <A HREF="http://www.engineered.net" TARGET=_blank>www.engineered.net</A>  .  my former 86 SE.. now owned by GT Bastard and pics of what my GT looked like when I bought it on July 1st from GT Bastard. if you have any other questions or comments don't hesitate to ask! I have mpg movies of my car on the dyno if you'd like to have that?!<P>take care,<BR>Travis<BR>1FST2M6<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig1fst.jpg"> ||||reg||1
